From 6e4381f49a8f28f3e3548534b4517f021ec34df8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saeed Al Balushi <saeedsami559@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:38:59 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign home page: Oman/Mars slider, impact, how it works

- Add an Oman <-> Mars before/after slider using the existing NASA
  elevation layers (NASADEM and MOLA), one tab per intended pair
- Add "How it works" and "Why it matters" sections (impact criterion)
- Show a shaded-relief thumbnail on every site card
- Replace the 87% "highest match" stat with the best Mars average, so
  the headline number follows the same ranking as the cards
- Turn the AMADEE-18 sanity check into a rank strip and explain why
  Dhofar ranks lower (no cloud-free EMIT minerals data)
- Add a site footer: Team VEX, challenge, data credits, GitHub link
- Icons for the ground rules, quieter "not available" flags,
  shorter hero chip, soft planet glow while textures load
- English and Arabic strings for everything new

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PKf9FXgx2mUELuaeWkfGG5
